and scanner.c's automatic-semicolon tokens (a statement that continues, `for ... in` after an initializer,
an arrow body's end), which packages/syntechs/src/grammars/javascript/scanner.ts ports.
tree-sitter-typescript does not build on this: it keeps upstream tree-sitter-javascript 0.23.1.

